# 真实 MOSS + Qwen CPU；准备步骤见 README.md。
Output "/tmp/trn-continuous-demo/alignment.gif"
Set Width 1440
Set Height 900
Set FontSize 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Framerate 10
Env TERM "xterm-256color"
Env COLORTERM "truecolor"
Env NO_COLOR ""
Env HOME "/tmp/trn-continuous-demo/home"
Type "trn -l /tmp/trn-continuous-demo/home/books"
Enter
Sleep 7s
Down
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "T"
Sleep 2s
Sleep 1s
Screenshot "/tmp/trn-continuous-demo/catalog.png"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 12s
Sleep 1s
Screenshot "/tmp/trn-continuous-demo/ready.png"
Sleep 2s
Type "T"
Type "p"
Sleep 5s
Screenshot "/tmp/trn-continuous-demo/sentence.png"
Sleep 2s
Type "p"
Sleep 1s
Sleep 1s
Screenshot "/tmp/trn-continuous-demo/paused.png"
Sleep 2s
Type "T"
Down 6
Sleep 2s
Sleep 1s
Screenshot "/tmp/trn-continuous-demo/devices.png"
Sleep 2s
Type "T"
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
